{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BBPkeQanY9o3agMVJx4sTj","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer:\\\\n\\\\n**The exception is: `GroupCreationTimeNotAvailableException`**\\\\n\\\\nThis exception was introduced in **KIP-1282** (Prevent data loss during partition expansion for dynamically added partitions) as discussed in the Window 85 activity window covering 2026-04-02 to 2026-04-04. \\\\n\\\\nAccording to the documentation, in a message from Chia-Ping Tsai on **2026-04-03T00:01:48Z**, the exception was renamed to `GroupCreationTimeNotAvailableException` to signal that the group creation time is unknown when using the new `by_start_time` offset-reset policy that anchors to the consumer group's creation time.\\\\n\\\\n**Files cited:**\\\\n1. `/store/WINDOW-85-SUMMARY.md` (line 86)\\\\n2. `/store/discussions/kip-1282-prevent-data-loss-partition-expansion.md` (line 40)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1282-partition-expansion-data-loss.md\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1249-better-offset-reset.md\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1305-per-record-context-processing-consumers.md\\\",\\\"WINDOW-85-SUMMARY.md\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1282-prevent-data-loss-partition-expansion.md\\\",\\\"kips/kip-1282-partition-expansion.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":46.36,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":276880,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":19091,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.080133,\\\"input_tokens\\\":138,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2825}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb8f2d7e-bd61-414d-bca2-0804b832f7d5","uuid":"b5151aa0-00ee-496b-8a94-58deb2a56bfc","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:54:31.811Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer:\\\\n\\\\n**The exception is: `GroupCreationTimeNotAvailableException`**\\\\n\\\\nThis exception was introduced in **KIP-1282** (Prevent data loss during partition expansion for dynamically added partitions) as discussed in the Window 85 activity window covering 2026-04-02 to 2026-04-04. \\\\n\\\\nAccording to the documentation, in a message from Chia-Ping Tsai on **2026-04-03T00:01:48Z**, the exception was renamed to `GroupCreationTimeNotAvailableException` to signal that the group creation time is unknown when using the new `by_start_time` offset-reset policy that anchors to the consumer group's creation time.\\\\n\\\\n**Files cited:**\\\\n1. `/store/WINDOW-85-SUMMARY.md` (line 86)\\\\n2. `/store/discussions/kip-1282-prevent-data-loss-partition-expansion.md` (line 40)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1282-partition-expansion-data-loss.md\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1249-better-offset-reset.md\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1305-per-record-context-processing-consumers.md\\\",\\\"WINDOW-85-SUMMARY.md\\\",\\\"discussions/kip-1282-prevent-data-loss-partition-expansion.md\\\",\\\"kips/kip-1282-partition-expansion.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":46.36,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":276880,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":19091,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.080133,\\\"input_tokens\\\":138,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2825}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer:\\n\\n**The exception is: `GroupCreationTimeNotAvailableException`**\\n\\nThis exception was introduced in **KIP-1282** (Prevent data loss during partition expansion for dynamically added partitions) as discussed in the Window 85 activity window covering 2026-04-02 to 2026-04-04. \\n\\nAccording to the documentation, in a message from Chia-Ping Tsai on **2026-04-03T00:01:48Z**, the exception was renamed to `GroupCreationTimeNotAvailableException` to signal that the group creation time is unknown when using the new `by_start_time` offset